{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44496","headline":"诗三百三首 一九三 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一九三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久住寒山凡几秋，独吟歌曲绝无忧。\n蓬扉不掩常幽寂，泉涌甘浆长自流。\n石室地鑪砂鼎沸，松黄柏茗乳香瓯。\n饥餐一粒伽陀药，心地调和倚石头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}